&lt;br /&gt;(Hoping you read this...) You characterize Jews as &amp;quot;Hook-nosed monstrosities.&amp;quot; Do you know why Jews have such big noses? Because air is free! &lt;br /&gt;(Joke told to me by a Jew - some of the nicer ones ARE able to laugh at themselves.)&lt;br /&gt;- Lemuel.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/5094139919802175683'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/5094139919802175683'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1277224579203#c5094139919802175683' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4486014205047490380' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4486014205047490380' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 22, 2010 at 10:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3572121001767824435</id><published>2010-06-22T04:40:22.085-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-22T04:40:22.085-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Apollonian,&#xa;&#xa;My post was already so long that I di...</title><content type='html'>Apollonian,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My post was already so long that I did not give citations for some of my historical assertions. Nevertheless all of them are factual.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Your tone to Mr. Grigg is aggressive and baitingly provocative. Remember, this is HIS blog and you are a guest in HIS space. If you do not behave as a guest should, he would be within his rights to ask you to leave.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Re. the &amp;quot;Holohoax,&amp;quot; I have EXTENSIVELY studied all sides of this question. The revisionists would like to say that the Nazis murdered not a single Jew. The Jews would like to say that the Nazis murdered six million of them. I believe the truth lies somewhere in between.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is no doubt that the SS murdered some half-million Russian civilians in Operation Barbarossa, most being Communist Party officials, and among these were at least 300,000 Jews. Hitler asked the Gestapo to do the job, Gestapo General Heinrich Mueller refused, and so Himmler&amp;#39;s SS did the necessary work. It is all documentd by daily body count reports, still to be found in the German archives.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is also no doubt that Odilo Globocnik murdered nearly 2 million Jews in the camps he ran in Poland - Adolf Eichmann admitted as much in his trial testimony, which is available on several sites. A huge number of Jewish survivors after the war had lost their entire extended families.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is also true that the figure of 6 million was arrived at by deduction - by counting prewar and postwar Jewish populations. This is not an accurate method. A huge number of Jews prewar emigrated to Argentina, Palestine, America, Britain, and many other countries. Also, as I mentioned, Stalin killed at least 300,000 of the disappeared Jews. And a great many died of &amp;quot;natural&amp;quot; causes - disease and hunger - in the camps. The original number of murdered proposed at Nuremberg was 20 million, but this was obviously preposterous, and it was reduced and reduced till six million was finally arrived at. Even this number is highly doubtful.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It was, for example, also alleged at Nuremberg that 30,000 were gassed at Dachau. In fact Dachau had no gas chambers (it was only a few miles outside Munich and this could easily be verified) but did have crematoria for disposing of the dead, who mostly died of typhus due to overcrowding. After Nuremberg the number &amp;quot;gassed at Dachau&amp;quot; was eventually officially revised down to zero.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So the likeliest number for the planned extermination of Jews is anywhere from 2.5 million to 3.0 million. Nobody knows, and neither side wants to make a serious effort to arrive at a real figure. Even so, this was a horrendous crime, in my opinion mostly because of its coldly deliberate nature.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;However, it has ever since been used - or abused - by Jews, who never suffered these horrors, to extort untold tens of billions of guilt-money from Germany, the USA, Switzerland, and other countries. I highly recommend you to read the book &amp;quot;The Holocaust Industry&amp;quot; by Norman Finkelstein, whose mother had an Auschwitz number tattooed on her arm, and who only ever received some $1,000 in compensation from these &amp;quot;Holocaust Reparations&amp;quot; organizations, out of the hundred billion or more dollars they have managed to extort. If she had received her fair share thereof, it should have been at least a million dollars, not a thousand. The rest of this blood-money was stolen by professional extortionist Jews who obviously care not one flea-fart for the sufferings their own people endured.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In fact, we Gentiles probably feel more horror at those events than those Jews who profess such outrage, and chant &amp;quot;Never Again&amp;quot; as justification for all their murders, thefts, corruption, and viciousness.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In closing, please be less rude and provocative toward Mr. Grigg. He is a fine man and a crusader for truth and justice, who deserves our gratitude, not our baiting.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/3572121001767824435'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/3572121001767824435'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1277203222085#c3572121001767824435' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4486014205047490380' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4486014205047490380' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 22, 2010 at 4:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-882182452526459042</id><published>2010-06-20T17:46:58.429-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-20T17:46:58.429-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Grigg: why were u let go fm New American?--do u th...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;Grigg: why were u let go fm New American?--do u think it was, at least partially, ur persistent publication/affirmation of holohoax lies?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You should take up that question with Jack McManus, who sees the world much as you do. This would be a challenging conversation, since it is as difficult for Jack to tell the truth as it is for you to write intelligibly (is it even possible to converse in texting shorthand?).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;Jews are NOT &amp;quot;white&amp;quot; Mr. Grigg--no more than mestizos and mulattos--u already admitted ur wife is Jew or part Jew&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There are Jews of every conceivable phenotype, from fair-skinned, blonde-over-blue to mahogany-hued Ethiopians. I&amp;#39;m surprised that someone as monomaniacal on the subject as yourself would miss that rather large and obvious fact.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;white&amp;quot; is an abstraction, hence it requires definition--thus for it to have any real meaning &amp;quot;white&amp;quot; cannot have any part non-white--otherwise everything is &amp;quot;white&amp;quot; but for pure-blood non-white, obviously.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You&amp;#39;re not describing an abstraction, but rather a figment of imagination. There is no such thing as ethnic purity -- outside of a handful of severely isolated enclaves (and then only dubiously within them). &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Defining one&amp;#39;s worldview with reference to a mythical abstraction is a symptom of incurable subjectivism, is it not?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Tell you what: Rather than replying on this thread, why don&amp;#39;t you hang out your own cyber-shingle and dispense your insights, such as they are, in &lt;i&gt;that&lt;/i&gt; forum?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/882182452526459042'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/882182452526459042'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1277077618429#c882182452526459042' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/S9pLFt945PI/AAAAAAAAGn