uot; false charge against me for being irrational, but then refuse to publish my substantial response?--answer: u hate white folk and spokesmen in raging subconscious fashion, un-questionably, and this hatred expresses itself unfailingly and inexorably, as in ur compulsive un-fairness for blog dialectic.  And yes, I know u sometimes publish an extensive dialectic for my anti-semitism, but u cannot desist fm substantial censorship in pathetic effort to prejudice favorably ur own views.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;U could be a passive-aggressive type; I can&amp;#39;t be too sure.  But u&amp;#39;re surely extremely SUBJECTIVISTIC (hence anti-white for basic mentality and culture) for personal philosophy, pretending to a perfectly &amp;quot;free&amp;quot; will and &amp;quot;good-evil&amp;quot; Pelagian heresy.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;CONCLUSION: How otherwise, Mr. Grigg, would u relate w. and defend Jew monsters--UNLESS u hated humanity, esp. then white folk?  Honest elections and death to the Fed.  Apollonian</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/7445704305499192547'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/7445704305499192547'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1277055222015#c7445704305499192547' title=''/><author><name>apollonian</name><uri>http://defenderofprecioustruth.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4486014205047490380' sourc