ereticalists who worship Jews and say Christ was Jew (hence Talmudist), and who support enemy terror-state of Israel.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;So the task, once again, is to promote and elevate TRUTH against lies--that&amp;#39;s why Jews must be eliminated without anymore being said, ipso facto--but there&amp;#39;s obviously more to it all as (a) one must eliminate JCs first, even before Jews, and (b) overall cult of lies and lying must be understood as founded in SUBJECTIVISM, and for foremost thematic example, (c) that supremely HUBRISTIC pretence and presumption to &amp;quot;good-evil&amp;quot; Pelagian heresy.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But I&amp;#39;m afraid things are toooooooooooooooooo far gone, presently, for much headway to be made against dread, horrific ZOG-Mammon empire-of-lies--which must first run its course, like a forest-fire, simply burning itself out for the most part--there&amp;#39;s just too great an excess over-population which must be expended.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;CONCLUSION: Only the lucky survivors will then have chance to start civilization over once again--merely in order to build-up to yet another hubristic peak of over-population, then another denouement in CYCLIC fashion.  Jews are just that socio-biologic mechanism which takes out excess over-populated gentiles suffering terminal hubris.  Honest elections and death to the Fed.  Apollonian</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/2084581268324342446'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/2084581268324342446'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1276874585443#c2084581268324342446' title=''/><author><name>apollonian</name><uri>http://defenderofprecioustruth.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</ema