e there is indubitably hist. precedents to original institution of such Fed COUNTERFEITING conspiracy/enterprise too--but this account is essentially similar in principle for necessary course of degeneration after such institution--and that&amp;#39;s the overall theme of aforementioned HUBRIS.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(b) And thus this basic criminal conspiracy (Fed counterfeiting) is founded upon and further fosters general &amp;quot;Tower-of-Babel&amp;quot; syndrome by which people speak in terms of such confusing ABSTRACTIONS and intellectualist pretension, by which the poor volk are soooooooooo mis-led, dazzled, and deceived, poor &amp;quot;over-populated&amp;quot; fools.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For example, what is meant by &amp;quot;capitalism&amp;quot;? (or &amp;quot;free market&amp;quot;)--is it just the handling of large amounts of money? (of course not)--is &amp;quot;free market&amp;quot; mere chaos whence proverbial &amp;quot;devil takes hindmost&amp;quot;?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(c) So what&amp;#39;s needed then is a great cultural SIMPLIFICATION, this always founded most expediently upon hatred of some easily identified enemy--in the effort to preserving some genuine sentimental value like volk, race, and religion, etc.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Pt. then is this step (c) is INEVITABLE--it only awaits the ever-greater horrific circumstances to generate enough pressure to successfully bringing it about, SOONER OR LATER.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(d) Hence then, this above exposition of inexorable progress of historic CYCLE up-coming is why I so urgently and earnestly WARN PEOPLE about defending Jew monsters (just ck their Talmud whenever u think u&amp;#39;re not sure about Jews) who are guaranteed to attempting every possible circumvention of inevitable justice against them.  Observe now they (Jews and cohorts) want to start a war w. Iran--or N. Korea, whichever is most expedient.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(e) Further, I pt. out in advance Jews&amp;#39; foremost accommodators and traitors/sell-outs among gentiles, the &amp;quot;Judeo-Christian&amp;quot; (JC--see Whtt.org and TruthTellers.org for expo/ref.) hereticalists who do their best to assist Jews and associated criminals.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For there is indubitably a way of COUNTERING these vile JC traitors and collaborators by means of the real and &amp;quot;true&amp;quot; Christianity, which is assuredly NOT &amp;quot;rocket-science&amp;quot; or mysticism, but which only requires merest HONESTY for the principles manifest fm dear New Testament (NT).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thus we see great virtue of BLOGGING-ART which is DIALECTIC above all else--by which best information and analysis is produced and procured.  Again, note the aim, philosophically, is to uphold Christian TRUTH against LIES--and it&amp;#39;s this LYING mentality which is the great enemy, opponent, and culprit, common even unto gentiles (like JCs who say Christ was Jew (hence Talmudist)).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;CONCLUSION: Thus as Historic CYCLE continues to culminate the people identify evermore surely who the real enemy really and truly is--it&amp;#39;s why this vile enemy want to remove mighty internet and place yet another (the THIRD, now) Jew on US Sup. Ct. to bringing this cultural perdition about.  Honest elections and death to the Fed.  Apollonian</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/8077311270469834621'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/8077311270469834621'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1276718545365#c8077311270469834621' title=''/><author><name>apollonian</name><uri>http://defenderofprecioustruth.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4486014205047490380' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4486014205047490380' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2108007838"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 16, 2010 at 2:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2951844388466498273</id><published>2010-06-16T12:52:28.587-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-16T12:52:28.587-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anon @ 0800, you make a compelling point about the...</title><content type='html'>Anon @ 0800, you make a compelling point about the standard &amp;quot;Armed State Savior&amp;quot; homily -- but I&amp;#39;m not sure QoS fits that narrative as tidily as you think. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;First of all, Quantum is &lt;i&gt;not&lt;/i&gt; a private concern. It&amp;#39;s a corporatist one made up of people embodying Adam Smith&amp;#39;s concept of &amp;quot;The Man of System&amp;quot; -- in this case, a &amp;quot;state capitalist&amp;quot; who profits through corrupt collusion with government(s) and sees nothing amiss in treating people as pawns in his (their) grand designs. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Another distinction between QoS and every other Bond film I can think of is this: &lt;i&gt;Every&lt;/i&gt; government institution depicted in the film -- from the White House to 10 Downing Street, from Langley to the SIS Building, all the way down to local police in La Paz, Bolivia -- is utterly corrupt and compromised. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bond of necessity goes rogue; the only people he grudgingly trusts are M (who initially thinks Bond has turned) and Felix Leiter -- and both of them are rogue elements, as well. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I find it interesting that in my favorite Bond film, On Her Majesty&amp;#39;s Secret Service, 007 has to enlist the help of the Union Corse (the criminal syndicate headed by his future father-in-law) to defeat Blofeld&amp;#39;s bio-warfare plot and rescue his fiancee, Tracey. MI6, on the orders of the UN Security Council (!), had been ordered to stand down because of a deal with Blofeld. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Of course, Bond was a literary creation of a guy who was deeply entrenched in the secret doings of the Anglophile Network referred to by Carroll Quigley. This is why the Bond novels and films tend to promote the &amp;quot;police/state worship&amp;quot; model. And this, in turn, is why I was surprised to see how QoS subverted that model in some important ways.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Just my inflation-ravaged .25 on the matter....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/2951844388466498273'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/2951844388466498273'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1276714348587#c2951844388466498273' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/S9pLFt945PI/AAAAAAAAGnM/ZkLMUakTnDM/S220/dad.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4486014205047490380' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4486014205047490380' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 16, 2010 at 12:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4421172163096500116</id><published>2010-06-16T10:23:50.954-06:00</published><updated>2010-06-16T10:23:50.954-06:00</updated><title type='text'>To anonymous at 06 16 2010 -&amp;gt; 0800:&#xa;&#xa;You fail t...</title><content type='html'>To anonymous at 06 16 2010 -&amp;gt; 0800:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You fail to note (and mention that you noted) that QOS is EXACTLY the standard police/state worship movie.  The bad guys are ALWAYS private, and the tax fed parasites are ALWAYS &amp;quot;the ONLY ones who can save everyone else.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Oh, and a point of interest, every last actor who played James Bond was a rabid anti gunner.  Sean Connery was the face of victim disarmament in England, the rest have all made their views known at one stage or another (whether to help their careers by getting political clout, or because they actually knew what they were doing, is hard to say.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hope that helps you see the ... &amp;quot;bigger&amp;quot; motion picture playing for all of us to watch. :)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/4421172163096500116'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4486014205047490380/comments/default/4421172163096500116'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/06/quantum-of-suffering-economic-hitmen.html?showComment=1276705430954#c4421172163096500116' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://